# The preset dumps and the packed banks are byte-exact ROM data. Git's binary detection happens to get
# every one of them right today, but core.autocrlf is on and one dump without a NUL byte in it would be
# silently mangled on checkout, so say it outright.
*.syx binary
*.bin binary
*.wav binary
*.png binary
